translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_35eeeb24:

    my "塞巴斯，你今天的话太粗心了 记住我的话"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_e9fca601:

    "但塞布的中断打断了。"

