translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_281e4f65:

    "你身上的体型非常大 但看起来不像是侵略性的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6fb88db3:

    kg "陛下，敌人来了，我们必须马上赶回宫殿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6322b266:

    "你的心跳跳过一跳 你做了什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_c416325a:

    "当塞巴斯无声无息地走到你面前时 警卫们朝马车飞去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_14989b10:

    ct "等待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a235a04a:

    ct "塞巴斯，是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_52b17bda:

