translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_54e32233:

    s "不，只是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_9389266b:

    kg "可能是间谍干的 我们冒不起风险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_d848c448:

    "警卫突然停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_f0a08a11:

    ct "那我们下次再继续吧 塞巴斯 保持警惕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_7ea473f7:

    "当你和塞巴斯转过身来，马车已经向相反的方向出发了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a2d2cfa5:

    "很快，你们两个就被单独留守了 叶子怪物在你们之间走过 慢慢地向前看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_0da34c5c:

