translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_ef9da69c:

    "眼睁睁地看着怀疑和不安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_b7daa2a2:

    s "只是一点点？"

